    \MECHCOMMENTS: THESE REACTIONS MAY FORM A LINK BETWEEN THE C2/C3/C4 MECHANISM AND THE AROMATIC MECHANISM. THEY ARE STANDALONE WITHIN AROMATIC MODULE, BUT ARE REQUIRED IF ADDING AROMATIC CHEMISTRY TO THE CORE MECHANISM.N
    \MECHCOMMENTS: PROBABLY NEED A BETTER NAME FOR THIS SUBMECH.
    \MECHWARNINGS:
    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
